 "splits": {
  "11": [
   {
    "text": "You are.",
    "speaker": "Sarah"
   },
   {
    "text": "No--",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   }
  ],
  "52": [
   {
    "text": "He believed those visions were messages sent.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "He also believed in the lost city of Atlantis.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "56": [
   {
    "text": "We're being followed.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Since the airport.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "66": [
   {
    "text": "What's the condition of the girls now?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Both lost a lot of blood.",
    "speaker": "Detective Costa"
   }
  ],
  "112": [
   {
    "text": "And how did you find this Ghouli?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "I fell into this hole into its lair, I guess.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   }
  ],
  "114": [
   {
    "text": "What about Brianna Stapleton?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I didn't see anybody else.",
    "speaker": "Sarah"
   }
  ],
  "115": [
   {
    "text": "She was on the floor, next to you.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Also injured.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "122": [
   {
    "text": "Someone was next to me.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   },
   {
    "text": "I couldn't see him. It was a dark figure.",
    "speaker": "Sarah"
   }
  ],
  "126": [
   {
    "text": "I would just end up back inside again.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   },
   {
    "text": "Like a maze.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "129": [
   {
    "text": "A souvenir.",
    "speaker": "Sarah"
   },
   {
    "text": "Yeah. You shake it and it snows.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   }
  ],
  "143": [
   {
    "text": "And the girls apparently the same boyfriend.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Jackson Van de Kamp.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "144": [
   {
    "text": "Scully.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I know.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "145": [
   {
    "text": "Mulder, it has to be a coincidence.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "No, it's not. You were sent here.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "146": [
   {
    "text": "We are meant to be here.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "We gotta find out where this kid lives.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "161": [
   {
    "text": "There's something dirty in the water.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "The back door was open.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "247": [
   {
    "text": "Have you been there the whole time?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "No, but I heard enough.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "254": [
   {
    "text": "We can get a DNA comparison at the lab here.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Okay.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "274": [
   {
    "text": "It's not good news.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I know. It's William.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "296": [
   {
    "text": "But this doesn't change anything.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Not yet.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "299": [
   {
    "text": "Oh. Aah! I'm sorry.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Aah! Oh.",
    "speaker": "Stranger"
   }
  ],
  "302": [
   {
    "text": "No, it's my fault. I'm sorry.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "It's okay.",
    "speaker": "Stranger"
   }
  ],
  "335": [
   {
    "text": "Let me guess, the DOD.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "And the DOJ.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "344": [
   {
    "text": "Bob?",
    "speaker": "Barista"
   },
   {
    "text": "Skinner, you're breaking up. I can't--",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "345": [
   {
    "text": "Bob?",
    "speaker": "Barista"
   },
   {
    "text": "Mulder....",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "346": [
   {
    "text": "Double cappuccino, extra foam?",
    "speaker": "Barista"
   },
   {
    "text": "Yeah. Yeah.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "353": [
   {
    "text": "Mulder, why did you wanna meet out here?",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   },
   {
    "text": "It's cold and it smells.",
    "speaker": "Walter Skinner"
   }
  ],
  "367": [
   {
    "text": "Project Crossroads.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I read the report.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "386": [
   {
    "text": "And we never discussed any suicidal ideation.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Scholz"
   },
   {
    "text": "Your claims don't describe the patient I know.",
    "speaker": "Dr. Scholz"
   }
  ],
  "412": [
   {
    "text": "It's a false reality, Scully.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Just like everything we've seen so far.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "424": [
   {
    "text": "Let's go.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Jackson knew he was being hunted.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "436": [
   {
    "text": "Thank God.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   },
   {
    "text": "They told me you were dead.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   }
  ],
  "446": [
   {
    "text": "Are you Ghouli?",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   },
   {
    "text": "No. There's no such thing as Ghouli.",
    "speaker": "Jackson Van De Kamp"
   }
  ],
  "447": [
   {
    "text": "I made up everything on the website.",
    "speaker": "Jackson Van De Kamp"
   },
   {
    "text": "No, Jackson.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   }
  ],
  "449": [
   {
    "text": "You attacked each other.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   },
   {
    "text": "You saw what I projected into your head.",
    "speaker": "Jackson Van De Kamp"
   }
  ],
  "455": [
   {
    "text": "That's really messed up.",
    "speaker": "Brianna"
   },
   {
    "text": "It is.",
    "speaker": "Jackson Van De Kamp"
   }
  ],
  "478": [
   {
    "text": "You have Jackson Van de Kamp in custody?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Not yet.",
    "speaker": "Detective Costa"
   }
  ],
  "481": [
   {
    "text": "How do you know he's inside?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I got a text from Sarah Turner. That's him.",
    "speaker": "Detective Costa"
   }
  ],
  "488": [
   {
    "text": "So I-- And I texted them.",
    "speaker": "Sarah"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm so sorry.",
    "speaker": "Sarah"
   }
  ],
  "493": [
   {
    "text": "This is-- This is all my fault.",
    "speaker": "Sarah"
   },
   {
    "text": "No, no, no. Look.",
    "speaker": "Jackson Van De Kamp"
   }
  ],
  "540": [
   {
    "text": "Are you following me?",
    "speaker": "Stranger"
   },
   {
    "text": "Hey.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "541": [
   {
    "text": "Didn't I see you at the hospital?",
    "speaker": "Stranger"
   },
   {
    "text": "It must be kismet. Heh.",
    "speaker": "Stranger"
   }
  ],
  "542": [
   {
    "text": "But I doubt we'll be seeing each other again.",
    "speaker": "Stranger"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm driving across country.",
    "speaker": "Stranger"
   }
  ],
  "547": [
   {
    "text": "Are you Dr. Masao Matsumoto?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "A doctor?",
    "speaker": "Stranger"
   }
  ],
  "558": [
   {
    "text": "The Pick Up Artist.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "What are you talking about?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "560": [
   {
    "text": "What did he say?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "He gave me a piece of advice. He said....",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ]
 },
 "text": {
  "9": "Are you Ghouli?",
  "13": "That's what Ghouli would say. You're trying to trick me.",
  "70": "Anonymous 911 call. Didn't leave a name.",
  "86": "He said that the girls asked him if he found Ghouli.",
  "89": "Ghouli probably feeds on human flesh.\nYawn.",
  "105": "Ghouli's real.",
  "117": "Okay? All I saw was Ghouli.",
  "120": "It felt real, like I was really living it. At first it was scary because I couldn't move.",
  "158": "...he realized he was gonna get caught and killed himself.",
  "185": "...so he was off his medication.",
  "193": "...because he wouldn't take the slave name given to his ancestral family.",
  "237": "And I thought...",
  "243": "I'm just so sorry.",
  "298": "I know it.",
  "311": "How many 17-year-olds with two girlfriends have a search history that clean?",
  "321": "Look at that. Hundreds of posts to ghouli.net.",
  "338": "...because the DOD is involved in a conspiracy they're trying to cover up.",
  "341": "You need to come back so we can discuss your activities.",
  "358": "When they decided to combine alien and human DNA to create hybrids.",
  "366": "...using components of alien technology, hybrid DNA.",
  "390": "...visions?",
  "417": "Her body was moved after she was shot to make it look like there was one shooter.",
  "445": "Like a prank. Like, you'd see the Ghouli and you just run away.",
  "505": "[CROWD CLAMORING]"
 },
